    "enUS": {
      "description": "Ah, while you were gone a tablet came for you, {name}.\n\nRead it when you have time. If I'm not mistaken, it came from the shaman trainer Shikrik. She would have words with you when you're ready.",
      "summary": "Speak to Shikrik in the Valley of Trials.",
      "title": "Rune-Inscribed Tablet",
